        "node_id": "n_7_8d929f",
        "thought_text": "Thought-2 (revised): Consider replacing the smallest number with a value that is a multiple of the current GCD, but also ensures that this new value does not exceed the upper limit of 10^9. This approach aims to maximize the GCD without violating the constraints.",
